        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} conjures a charming or frightening song. <em>Wisdom Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=qCn4ky0XrbGpC8yA]], each enemy in a 60-foot Emanation originating from the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}. <em>Failure:</em> The target is subjected to the song's effect:</p><p><strong>Charming.</strong> The target has the &amp;Reference[Charmed apply=false] condition for 1 minute. While Charmed, the target has the &amp;Reference[Incapacitated apply=false] condition and uses all its movement to dance in place. The effect ends on the target if it takes any damage.</p><p><strong>Frightening.</strong> [[/damage 2d6 + 3 average type=psychic]] damage, and the target has the &amp;Reference[Frightened apply=false] condition for 1 minute. If the target ends its turn out of line of sight from the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}, the condition ends on it.</p>",
